  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment FAQs\n\n### How do I stop the software automatically taking income tax via PAYE?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 9 Apr, 2019 at  2:29 PM\n\n\t\tSimply select the boxes 2 and 3 under Self Assessment >> Main Form >> Finishing your tax return >> Tax Refunded or set off (refer attached) to get the desired results. \n\n\t\tStep 1 (1).png (32.4 KB) Step 2 (1).png (16 KB) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188547\">Self Assessment FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How do I stop the software automatically taking income tax via PAYE?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 9 Apr, 2019 at  2:29 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\tSimply select the boxes 2 and 3 under Self Assessment &gt;&gt; Main Form &gt;&gt; Finishing your tax return &gt;&gt; Tax Refunded or set off (refer attached) to get the desired results. <p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t<div class=\"cs-g-c attachments\" id=\"article-9000166421-attachments\"><div class=\"attachment\"><img src=\"/images/helpdesk/attachments/9075310586/thumb\" onerror=\"default_image_error(this)\" class=\"file-thumbnail image\" alt=\"Step 1 (1).png\"><div class=\"attach_content\"><div class=\"ellipsis\"><a href=\"/helpdesk/attachments/9075310586\" class=\"filename\" target=\"_blank\" \n                >Step 1 (1).png </a></div><div>(32.4 KB) </div></div></div><div class=\"attachment\"><img src=\"/images/helpdesk/attachments/9075310588/thumb\" onerror=\"default_image_error(this)\" class=\"file-thumbnail image\" alt=\"Step 2 (1).png\"><div class=\"attach_content\"><div class=\"ellipsis\"><a href=\"/helpdesk/attachments/9075310588\" class=\"filename\" target=\"_blank\" \n                >Step 2 (1).png </a></div><div>(16 KB)